---
import '../../styles/portal-tokens.css';
import PortalHead from '../../components/ui/PortalHead.astro';
export const prerender = false;
Astro.response.headers.set('Cache-Control', 'private, no-store');
Astro.response.headers.set('Referrer-Policy', 'no-referrer');
Astro.response.headers.set('X-Robots-Tag', 'noindex, nofollow, noarchive');
Astro.response.headers.set('X-Frame-Options', 'DENY');
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow, noarchive" />
    <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer" />
    <PortalHead/>
    <title>Pemilihan selesai · Portal Siswa</title>
    <style>
      :root { font-family: var(--font-portal); color: var(--color-ink); background: var(--color-paper); }
      body { min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 24px; }
      main { width: min(100%, 520px); padding: 36px; border: 1px solid #dce5df; border-radius: 18px; background: white; text-align: center; }
      .mark { display: grid; width: 64px; height: 64px; margin: 0 auto 22px; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; background: #e5f2e9; color: #17643f; font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; }
      h1 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 1.8rem; }
      p { color: #58685e; line-height: 1.6; }
      a { display: inline-flex; min-height: 46px; margin-top: 14px; padding: 12px 18px; align-items: center; border-radius: 8px; background: #17643f; color: white; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
      a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #e6a800; outline-offset: 3px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <div class="mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
      <h1>Pemilihan Anda telah selesai</h1>
      <p>Terima kasih telah berpartisipasi. Sesi pemilihan pada perangkat ini telah berakhir.</p>
      <p>Jika perangkat akan digunakan siswa berikutnya, lanjutkan ke halaman masuk.</p>
      <a href="/siswa/masuk">Siswa berikutnya</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
